For generations, North Carolina families have gathered around the roar of engines and the excitement of race day. 

@NASCAR is part of our state’s identity, supporting jobs, local businesses, tourism, and communities across North Carolina while bringing families together.  It was great meeting with NASCAR Vice Chairman and Senior Adviser Mike Helton to discuss the future of motorsports, continued investment in North Carolina, and opportunities to grow an industry with deep roots in our state.  

North Carolina helped shape NASCAR’s history, and I’m proud to support its future.

